    Bug 1755068 - Hook up "sessionstore-windows-restored" logic (make EnterpricePolicies apply properly). r=darktrojan


    The policy is applied through "sessionstore-windows-restored" notifications, so we need to mirror
    a bit more of what Firefox does with that.

    For testing, add e.g. a obj-x86_64-pc-linux-gnu/dist/bin/distribution/policies.json containing

    ```
    {
     "policies": {
       "DisableAppUpdate": true,
       "PrimaryPassword": true
     }
    }
    ```

    When applied, and you try to save a password you'll get the set up Primary Passowrd dialog before you can proceed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D249050

